sequenceDiagram

    actor Employee
    participant Client as MAUI / Web Client
    participant API as Expense API
    participant Service as Expense Service
    participant File as Receipt Storage
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant Audit as Audit Service
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Employee->>Client: Enter expense
    Employee->>Client: Attach optional receipt

    Client->>API: POST /expenses
    API->>API: Authenticate & authorize

    API->>Service: Submit expense
    Service->>Service: Validate expense
    Service->>DB: Save expense

    alt Receipt attached
        Client->>API: Upload receipt
        API->>File: Store receipt
        File-->>API: Storage reference
        API->>DB: Save receipt metadata
    end

    Service->>Audit: Record submission
    Service->>Notify: Notify Super Admin

    Service-->>API: Expense submitted
    API-->>Client: Pending review